sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员在会话列表看到「@ 了我」/「N 条@」角标，点进会话读完后角标消失
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=partial；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  UI->>Gate: 订阅 @提及计数与消减（当前 Gate 由 inbound event 驱动）
  Go-->>WS: authority event / channel update
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(bytes)
  E->>IM: dispatch inbound event
  IM->>IM: 校验 event_seq、generation、viewer scope 与幂等键
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：触发条件四项全满足才累计：hasServerId 和和 hasMsgIndex === -1（新消息非更新）和和 data.userId !== currentUserId 和和 mentions.includes(currentUserId)；写 mentionList = [...prev, data.id]（按 data.id 去重，已存在则整条分支跳过）、mentionCount = nextList.length、mentionUser = userSnapshot.userName ／／ 原值 ／／ ””，驱动会话列表「N 条@」角标与聊天底部 @
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：hasServerId 和和 hasMsgIndex === -1 不满足时不得累计：更新态消息与无 server id 的乐观消息一律不计（否则乐观回显 + 服务端回声会双计）；同一 data.id 不得重复计入 mentionList（重复推送 / 补齐重放必须幂等）
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：channelUpdate，INCREMENT_CHANNEL，im:channel:update；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
